Found this Corvette in my little town in Tuscany (Italy). The owner is a great dude, super chill and happy to show me his beauty with a smile. Has even a friend with a F150 Raptor that I saw sometimes nearby. 

&amp;#x200B;

The sound? Wow, absolutely awesome. Such a great, great car. 

&amp;#x200B;

Kudos to him! 

